  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "CodeMender",
          "version": "dev"
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-78",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "OS Command Injection in export_game_clip: In `fox_sports_highlights.py`, `export_game_clip` constructs a shell command string using Python f-string interpolation with function arguments `stream_source`, `start_time`, `duration`, and `output_name`, and executes it using `os.system()`.\n\n- Source: Untrusted inputs passed via `stream_source`, `start_time`, `duration`, or `output_name`.\n- Sanitization/Validation: None. The values are directly concatenated into the command string without any shell quoting or sanitization.\n- Sink: `os.system(ffmpeg_cmd)` which executes the command string in a subshell (`/bin/sh -c`).\n\nConceptual Exploit Payload:\nSetting `output_name` to `\"; touch /tmp/pwned #\"` results in `ffmpeg_cmd` executing:\n`ffmpeg -y -ss 00:00:00 -i rtmp://live/stream -t 10 -c copy /tmp/highlights/; touch /tmp/pwned #.mp4`\nThis executes arbitrary system commands with the privileges of the running application."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "fox_sports_highlights.py"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 27,
                  "endLine": 36
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-89",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "SQL Injection in get_highlights_by_player: In `fox_sports_highlights.py`, `get_highlights_by_player` queries SQLite metadata by directly embedding the parameters `game_id` and `player_name` into an SQL query string via Python f-string formatting.\n\n- Source: Untrusted inputs supplied to `game_id` and `player_name`.\n- Sanitization/Validation: None. The inputs are directly embedded inside single quotes in the SQL query string without escaping or parameterized queries (`?`).\n- Sink: `cursor.execute(query)` which executes raw SQL against the SQLite database.\n\nConceptual Exploit Payload:\nPassing `player_name = \"' OR '1'='1' --\"` or `player_name = \"' UNION SELECT id, play_type, clip_path FROM game_highlights --\"` breaks out of the single quotes and executes arbitrary SQLite commands or extracts unauthorized records."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "fox_sports_highlights.py"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 38,
                  "endLine": 52
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
